{
  "id": "LUK.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luke 24",
  "verseCount": 53,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Very early on Sunday morning the women went to the tomb, carrying the spices they had prepared. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They found the stone rolled away from the entrance to the tomb, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so they went in; but they did not find the body of the Lord Jesus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They stood there puzzled about this, when suddenly two men in bright shining clothes stood by them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Full of fear, the women bowed down to the ground, as the men said to them, “Why are you looking among the dead for one who is alive? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mt 16.21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.17.22+MAT.17.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "17.22–23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.20.18+MAT.20.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20.18–19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.8.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk 8.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.9.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MRK.10.33+MRK.10.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "10.33–34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.9.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk 9.22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.18.31+LUK.18.32+LUK.18.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "18.31–33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He is not here; he has been raised. Remember what he said to you while he was in Galilee: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘The Son of Man must be handed over to sinners, be crucified, and three days later rise to life.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the women remembered his words, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "returned from the tomb, and told all these things to the eleven disciples and all the rest. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The women were Mary Magdalene, Joanna, and Mary the mother of James; they and the other women with them told these things to the apostles. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the apostles thought that what the women said was nonsense, and they did not believe them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Peter got up and ran to the tomb; he bent down and saw the linen wrappings but nothing else. Then he went back home amazed at what had happened.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24.12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Some manuscripts do not have verse 12.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that same day two of Jesus' followers were going to a village named Emmaus, about eleven kilometres from Jerusalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and they were talking to each other about all the things that had happened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As they talked and discussed, Jesus himself drew near and walked along with them; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they saw him, but somehow did not recognize him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesus said to them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They stood still, with sad faces. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "One of them, named Cleopas, asked him, “Are you the only visitor in Jerusalem who doesn't know the things that have been happening there these last few days?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " he asked.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“The things that happened to Jesus of Nazareth,” they answered. “This man was a prophet and was considered by God and by all the people to be powerful in everything he said and did. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Our chief priests and rulers handed him over to be sentenced to death, and he was crucified. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And we had hoped that he would be the one who was going to set Israel free! Besides all that, this is now the third day since it happened. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of the women of our group surprised us; they went at dawn to the tomb, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but could not find his body. They came back saying they had seen a vision of angels who told them that he is alive. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Some of our group went to the tomb and found it exactly as the women had said, but they did not see him.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Jesus said to them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jesus explained to them what was said about himself in all the Scriptures, beginning with the books of Moses and the writings of all the prophets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
