          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the two were telling them this, suddenly the Lord himself stood among them and said to them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.24.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.24.36"
            ]
